# {{ project_title }}

## Getting started

- `npm run contribute` installs tools and dependencies, and heals the
  toolchain through `.config/git/hooks/heal.sh`. Node 25+ drops corepack,
  so the bootstrap starts from npm.
- `direnv allow` (if you use direnv) loads the environment.

For typescript projects, copy workflows into place:

    cp -r staged/.github/workflows .github/workflows
    git add .github/workflows

For java projects:

    ./mvnw -q verify

Unit tests live in `src/test/java`; integration tests live in
`src/testIntegration/java`. Both use `*Test` names. Failsafe runs the
integration tests during `verify`.

Fixture classes are published with the `test-fixtures` classifier. A module
that uses another module's fixtures declares `<classifier>test-fixtures</classifier>`
with `test` scope.

This project is managed with [copier](https://copier.readthedocs.io). To
refresh from the template:

    uvx copier update --trust

Renovate opens an update PR whenever
[base-template](https://github.com/xenoterracide/base-template) tags a
release. Merge it like any other dependency update.
